  "question": {
    "text": "If $z_{1}, z_{2}, z_{3}$ are imaginary numbers such that $\\left|z_{1}\\right|=\\left|z_{2}\\right|=\\left|z_{3}\\right|=\\left|\\frac{1}{z_{1}}+\\frac{1}{z_{2}}+\\frac{1}{z_{3}}\\right|=1,$ then\r\n$\\left|z_{1}+z_{2}+z_{3}\\right|$ is",
    "image": null
  },
